==Battleground==
*5 [[Croconator]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Croconator]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Croconator]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**10 [[Croconator]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**3 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
**5 [[Cadaver Bear]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**3 [[Cadaver Bear]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
You can beat this stage without defeating all the Cadaver Bears by rushing it before they become a problem. Use fast [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|rusher units]] such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], [[Sanada Yukimura (Uber Rare Cat)|Immortal Yukimura]], or [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] to kill the Heavenly Hippoes and destroy the base while the Cadaver Bears are still underground. [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Lion Cat]] can be useful for clearing out the Croconators.

It's not recommended to fight this stage head on, as the Cadaver Bears can be really painful to deal with, not to mention the strategy above is pretty consistent.

==Trivia==
*Coincidentally, the stage's name features [[:Wikipedia:Concord grapes|grapes]], which matches the purple color of [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|zombies]].

